{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"4ae222f09f7fd6c044d3c3c583469927fe43895313c35d8b2572829592b3bc64","ja":"力を合わせて","zh":"齐心协力","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"873da67bae1cfc7fdc4446b043757f6eb2cf74a166e5e802702105dd6bf212ed","ja":"さっきの西区画から見た時は、\nセリカの肉まん屋さんの絵だったんだけど……。","zh":"刚才从西区看的时候，\n明明画的是星梨花的肉包店……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fb9bd0d95bb6ed34c0cfec6c2e9f6c5f90d9587a6da1e46ce209c16e7683ba1f","ja":"今いる南区画から見たら、ユキホの工房で、\nフェアリー初号機の絵になってるでしょ。","zh":"从现在所在的南区看过去，在雪步的工作室那里，\n能看到妖精初号机的图画对吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"22134a3edebb6c674974e599c38f0c11d2fa016132619cb1d6951aa5e3470233","ja":"角度によって見える絵が違うんだ……あっ！","zh":"角度不同，看到的画也不一样呢……啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ba8780d45a83d9aebac7caaa6d2cb1ce9713e866161f29c9e6464b2dc5a023d6","ja":"も、もしかして、あの飛行船の絵って、\n謎解きのヒントなんじゃないかな？","zh":"难、难道说，那幅飞艇的画，\n其实是解谜的提示吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"34dfd15265eeb844a5f156a64f164fd4df67909e76d0c6348a59351259dd160d","ja":"そうかも！　謎は……これじゃない？　「右回りに\n空を泳ぎ、移り変わりを記して番号順に読め」って！","zh":"说不定真是！谜题……是不是这个？“顺时针\n游过天空，记录下变迁并按编号顺序阅读”！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"a9beae983bc02df08f45692fcfd9d5b2a763d3de91e02ae803e95506e7d6c8cf","ja":"解答欄も区画と同じ数だし、きっとそうだよ！\nすごい、恵美ちゃん！","zh":"答题栏的数量也和区域一样，肯定没错！\n太厉害了，恵美！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c210243c129b49282a4726df08a49b919d56f832c1b7a61ef50395c035738052","ja":"いや～、我ながらなかなかのお手柄ですな～。\nにゃははっ♪","zh":"哎呀～，我自己都觉得立了大功呢～。\n喵哈哈♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ef79e4bfbf67722b94bb1a9b171f82c1479621f277bc65f00d9a6703ae5f8ad7","ja":"順調に謎を解いていったふたりは、\nついに最後の謎に到達して……","zh":"顺利解开谜题的两人，\n终于来到了最后的谜题前……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"3ce65d7fd207977960f446d8db584934f328b9eecd0695e44558541b0dadd7f5","ja":"歯車がいっぱいついた機械と、\nばらばらになった歯車が置かれてるね。","zh":"装满了齿轮的机器，\n还有散落的齿轮放在这里呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"5775e36273222f6643dda54fcec6a8c60d33ebc7b720f57b10c0418625987c37","ja":"え～っと……「この工房では、ロボット軍団に\n対抗するための、特別な兵器が開発されていた」","zh":"嗯……“在这间工坊里，曾经开发过\n用来对抗机器人军团的特殊兵器”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a4d21bb057b7a00b2dfa422587bda48a7853e70f71f1d0ce08e353b70bac7fdc","ja":"「しかし歯車が外れ、動かない。やつらが来る前に、\n設計図に合わせて修理し、起動せよ」だって！","zh":"“‘可是齿轮脱落了，无法运转。在那些家伙到来之前，\n对照设计图完成修理，并启动它吧’……是这样写的！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"fd8cc7b422ad2de515857ff0eefe1510f7eae3020ba718297c8d32eaa5e9be93","ja":"ええ～っ！？　ど、どれを使えばいいのかな？\n歯車がたくさんありすぎてわからないよ～！？","zh":"欸欸～！？该、该用哪一个才好呢？\n齿轮太多了，完全搞不懂啊～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"5556a5edd5c1baf7dfda3d9dacea9ba060613c8fc51ef7313c2ee33ebd4c8c21","ja":"そ、それに設計図って、どこに……？","zh":"而、而且设计图又在、在哪里……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"c26f632104013ba8a11ea0908fb760dd036c87229a538e5e0ffd726e1083f4ea","ja":"……と、とりあえず、この辺のを\n適当にハメてみよっ！　えいっ！","zh":"……总、总之，先试着把这一块的\n随便嵌进去看看吧！喝！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"abb101384c0d50ce875c25c34ab0d53bc6945884d8884449855ec448139bd72a","ja":"「ブーッ！　不正解です」","zh":"“嘟——！回答错误”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"ce851ce2d32df1011aa17239f92073919119669548c5dee1c97431c43ed37f66","ja":"こっち！？　それともこっち！？\nうー、わっかんないって！　こんなの絶対無理だよ～！","zh":"这边！？还是这边！？\n呜～，根本搞不懂啦！这也太强人所难了吧～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1646.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"1a8eec51e69cb4a75594694fe82c73d4afdb5a38ed60c934a6799fbafcfbf6a6","ja":"……あっ！　も、もしかして、この歯車の中には\n正解がないのかも……！？","zh":"……啊！难、难道说，这些齿轮里\n其实根本没有正确答案……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
